puts to make this happen at various stages.\n\nHere are 30 inputs targeting each condition:\n\n```text\n\"2 1\\n\"\n\"1 1\\n\"\n\"3 1\\n\"\n\"4 1\\n\"\n\"5 1\\n\"\n\"2 2\\n\"\n\"3 3\\n\"\n\"4 4\\n\"\n\"5 5\\n\"\n\"3 2\\n\"\n\"4 2\\n\"\n\"5 2\\n\"\n\"4 3\\n\"\n\"5 3\\n\"\n\"5 4\\n\"\n\"6 3\\n\"\n\"7 4\\n\"\n\"8 5\\n\"\n\"9 6\\n\"\n\"10 7\\n\"\n\"6 4\\n\"\n\"7 5\\n\"\n\"8 6\\n\"\n\"9 7\\n\"\n\"10 8\\n\"\n\"2000 1000\\n\"\n\"2000 1\\n\"\n\"2000 2000\\n\"\n\"2000 1999\\n\"\n\"2000 2\\n\"\n```", "reasoning": "", "stop_reason": "stop", "blame": null, "reason": null}], "inputs": ["2 1\n", "1 1\n", "3 1\n", "4 1\n", "5 1\n", "2 2\n", "3 3\n", "4 4\n", "5 5\n", "3 2\n", "4 2\n", "5 2\n", "4 3\n", "5 3\n", "5 4\n", "6 3\n", "7 4\n", "8 5\n", "9 6\n", "10 7\n", "6 4\n", "7 5\n", "8 6\n", "9 7\n", "10 8\n", "2000 1000\n", "2000 1\n", "2000 2000\n", "2000 1999\n", "2000 2\n"], "n_requested": 30, "n_parsed": 30, "dropped": 0}
